* S05 selection fixture; not wireless qualification
VIN src 0 DC 0 AC 1
RSOURCE src input 50
* Capacitive-input parallel resonator before any gain stage.
CSEL input port 33p
RLOSS port ln 2.64899092551
LSEL ln 0 6.8e-07
CSELF port 0 1p
CTUNE port 0 5p
VSUP vcc 0 9
CIN1 port b1 1n
RBT1 vcc b1 22k
RBB1 b1 0 4.7k
Q1 c1 b1 e1 2N3904
RC1 vcc c1 1000
REU1 e1 eb1 15
REB1 eb1 0 220
CEB1 eb1 0 220p
CIN2 c1 b2 100p
RBT2 vcc b2 22k
RBB2 b2 0 4.7k
Q2 c2 b2 e2 2N3904
RC2 vcc c2 1000
REU2 e2 eb2 15
REB2 eb2 0 220
CEB2 eb2 0 220p
CBUF c2 bb 100p
RBTB vcc bb 10k
RBBB bb 0 10k
QBUF vcc bb ee 2N3904
REBUF ee 0 470
COBUF ee rf 1n
RRF rf 0 1000
RTEST rf 0 2000
CTEST rf 0 10p
.SUBCKT BAT85 1 2
D1 1 2 BAT85
